bds 5,0 "Track and turn report"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Track and turn report, heading/track/roll/speed snapshot reported
    by the flight management system.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 Table A-2-34.
    Note: signed angular fields use sign bit + magnitude encoding
    (not two's complement).

items

    RASTATUS "Roll Angle Status"
        definition
            Validity of the roll angle value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    RASIGN "Roll Angle Sign"
        definition
            Sign of the roll angle magnitude.
        element 1
            table
                0: Positive
                1: Negative
        remark
            Combined with RA into a single signed value
            (sign = 1 gives value - 2^9).

    RA "Roll Angle Magnitude"
        definition
            Magnitude of the roll angle.
        element 9
            unsigned quantity 45/256 "°"
        remark
            Combined with RASIGN into a single signed value.

    TTASTATUS "True Track Angle Status"
        definition
            Validity of the true track angle value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    TTASIGN "True Track Angle Sign"
        definition
            Sign of the true track angle magnitude.
        element 1
            table
                0: Positive
                1: Negative
        remark
            Combined with TTA into a single signed value,
            normalised to [0, 360).

    TTA "True Track Angle Magnitude"
        definition
            Magnitude of the true track angle.
        element 10
            unsigned quantity 90/512 "°"
        remark
            Combined with TTASIGN into a single signed value.

    GSSTATUS "Ground Speed Status"
        definition
            Validity of the ground speed value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    GS "Ground Speed"
        definition
            Ground speed.
        element 10
            unsigned quantity 2 "kt"

    TARSTATUS "Track Angle Rate Status"
        definition
            Validity of the track angle rate value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    TARSIGN "Track Angle Rate Sign"
        definition
            Sign of the track angle rate magnitude.
        element 1
            table
                0: Positive
                1: Negative
        remark
            Combined with TAR into a single signed value.

    TAR "Track Angle Rate Magnitude"
        definition
            Magnitude of the track angle rate.
        element 9
            unsigned quantity 8/256 "°/s"
        remark
            Combined with TARSIGN into a single signed value.

    TASSTATUS "True Airspeed Status"
        definition
            Validity of the true airspeed value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    TAS "True Airspeed"
        definition
            True airspeed.
        element 10
            unsigned quantity 2 "kt"
